      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1783677139753,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "so we can use memo to wrap component\nto only re-renders when its prop\nwill changes otherwise it will\nnot re-renders\n\nso always we can use memo with useState\n, useContext or any component we can\nwrap .",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "so we can use memo to wrap component\nto only re-renders when its prop\nwill changes otherwise it will\nnot re-renders\n\nso always we can use memo with useState\n, useContext or any component we can\nwrap .",
